 "scratch": "设定糖果总数为45颗，每袋装6颗。计算45÷6。6×7=42，45-42=3。所以商是7，余数是3。单位：袋，颗。",
 "solver_code": "def solve():\n    total = 45\n    per_bag = 6\n    quotient = total // per_bag\n    remainder = total % per_bag\n    return [quotient, remainder]",
 "stem": "妈妈买了 $45$ 颗糖果，每 $6$ 颗装一袋。可以装满几袋？还剩几颗？",
 "options": [],
 "answers": [
